[en.FOCUS_C08_ONE_SPARSE]
The Weak Link

[en.FOCUS_C08_ONE_SPARSE_desc]
What? Cozy Glow appointed Snips and Snails as the Minister of Defence? Hillarious! The troops of the illegal empires’ EEMD jurisdiction are now just a bunch of lazy and incompetent ponies. Infiltrating their territory is like entering one’s own backyard.\n\nWho knows what treasures we might find in their territory? Let’s go and test our luck...

[zh.FOCUS_C08_ONE_SPARSE]
百密一疏

[zh.FOCUS_C08_ONE_SPARSE_desc]
和煦光流竟然选了剪剪蜗蜗当国防部长？真好笑，他们统治下的伪帝国防区里的军队都是一群好吃懒做的无能之辈，渗透入境简直就像在后花园里走路。\n\n说不定防区里面有什么好东西呢？让我们去他们的地盘看看...

